# Pairs with GateOwnership. A leaked gate refuses every later split of the leaf.
MODULE: SetParentKeepsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SetParentAsync returns without releasing the leaf's split gate
PERTURBS: SetParentFinish

--- FIND
    /\ seed[l] = "writing"
    /\ gate' = [gate EXCEPT ![l] = "free"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ seed[l] = "writing"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is kept
    /\ gate' = gate
--- END
